            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Often, if you will not use the classes. A subscription-free machine costs only its purchase price, while a membership over many years can add as much again. For people who will use the content regularly, the subscription can be worth it. The right comparison is total cost over the years you expect to own the machine, not the price at checkout.",
          },
        },
      ],
    },
    {
      "@type": "Article",
      headline: title,
      description: description,
      author: { "@type": "Person", name: "Morgan Reyes" },
