          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">iFIT is worth it if you will use it often.</strong> Classes,
            automatic incline and scenic routes genuinely change how a treadmill gets used for
            people who need structure. For people who just run, it is an ongoing cost for features
            they will not use, and over a decade it can match the price of the machine.
          </p>
